<title>UK: Enterprise Inns appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Inns appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprise Inns Plc said on Tuesday that Hubert Reid will be appointed chairman of the company later today following the shareholders' annual meeting.</p>
<p>Reid, who used to be chairman of the Boddington Group until its acquisition by Greenalls Group Plc in 1995, will succeed Keith Millar who acted as chairman since the death of Michael Cottrell in October 1996.</p>
<p>Reid, 56, will resign as non-executive director of Greenalls.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
